{
  "dom_id": "step-16736",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Any number raised to the power of zero is equal to $1.$ For example, \n\n$$\n2^0 = 1 \\quad\\textrm{and}\\quad (-55)^0=1.\n$$\n\nTo understand why, let's try to convince ourselves that $2^0 = 1.$ First, we write down a table containing all of the powers of $2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{4} & =16 \\\\ {2}^{3} & =8 \\\\ {2}^{2} & =4 \\\\ {2}^{1} & =2 \\\\ {2}^{0} & =◻\\,?\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs we go down the list, the number in blue is divided by $2$ each time. Following this pattern, we must have \n\n$$\n2^{\\color{red}{0}}  = {\\color{blue}{2}}\\div 2 = 1.\n$$\n\nIt doesn't matter whether the number is positive or negative, a fraction or a decimal, big or small. Raising any non-zero number to the power of zero always gives $1.$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-16736\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"16736\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"3087\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-16736\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-1\">Introduction</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"16736\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n       